        "main_topic": [
         {
          "h_title": "Our Trusted Pod Partners.",
          "main_title": "Our Trusted Pod Partners.",
          "author": "Future Shade Melbourne",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 2,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "IDEAL FOR OUTDOOR MOMENTS",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Smart Living in Every Pod",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Whether you\u2019re hosting friends, enjoying family dinners, or simply unwinding after a long day, our BBQ Pods bring comfort, convenience, and style to your backyard. Designed with premium materials and modern features, they turn every evening into an experience.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Let our BBQ Pods be the centerpiece that helps you create memories, elevate your space, and enjoy life outdoors with ease and elegance.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "QUALITY, CUSTOMIsATION, AND STYLE",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Luxury Meets Personal Choice",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Crafted for those who value both durability and design, our BBQ Pods combine high-end stainless steel with premium finishes. Choose from sintered stone, powder-coated colors, or wood-grain textures to create a look that\u2019s uniquely yours. Every material is built to withstand the outdoors while delivering a sleek, modern aesthetic.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Whether you prefer a classic stainless finish, a bold contemporary tone, or a natural stone touch, your BBQ Pod can be customised to reflect your taste \u2014 making your outdoor kitchen truly one of a kind.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "BBQ Pod Products",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Is any special preparation required for installation?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Ground Requirements: The pod must be installed on a flat and solid surface, such as a 10 cm-thick concrete platform or a treated wood frame. Avoid placing it directly on soil or uneven ground. Space Clearance: Leave at least 15 cm of ventilation space on all sides and a minimum of 50 cm above the unit from flammable structures Water & Power: If your pod includes a refrigerator or sink, pre-plan for power outlets and plumbing for water in/out as needed.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Do I need professional installation?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "No, since the BBQ pod is delivered fully assembled, most units are plug-and-play.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "How is the BBQ pod delivered?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "The BBQ pod is delivered fully assembled. Please ensure there\u2019s sufficient access (gate width, path clearance) for forklifts or moving equipment for a fully assembled unit.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Can I customize the layout or add features?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Yes, we offer customization for size, layout, surface finishes, and accessories (e.g., fridges, sinks, power outlets, grills) with additional costs. Share your design or requirements with our team, and we will create a tailored solution.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "What are the Suitable Use Scenarios?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Backyards: Perfect for daily family BBQs or small gatherings. Weather-resistant and low-maintenance. Commercial Venues: Ideal for restaurant patios or guesthouse BBQ zones \u2013 durable, hygienic, and easy to clean. Coastal Villas: Excellent salt-air resistance makes it a great fit for outdoor kitchens near the sea.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Are the BBQ Pods weather-resistant?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Absolutely. Built from reinforced stainless steel with premium finishes, our pods are made to withstand rain, sun, and coastal conditions for years to come.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Do I need a building permit to install a BBQ Pod?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "No, our BBQ Pods are designed as standalone outdoor kitchens and generally do not require a building permit, making setup simple and stress-free.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "What surfaces can a BBQ Pod be placed on?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "We recommend installing on a flat, solid base such as a concrete slab or treated timber platform for best stability and performance.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "How is the BBQ Pod delivered?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Each pod is delivered fully assembled and ready to use. Please ensure access for forklifts or moving equipment during delivery.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Can I customise the look of my BBQ Pod?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Yes, you can choose from stainless steel, sintered stone, wood-grain textures, and a wide range of powder-coated colors to match your outdoor style.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
